6156e0a268842","session_date":"2023-03-26","session_datetime":"2023-03-26T16:45:00","session_id":"session_2","session_index":2,"source_sha256":"a5c02951a7d0d10b8e4700c26aad0ec44c2747cb1aa8d729217cd77dcad0555e","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":18}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","text":"Calvin: Woohoo! I finally got myself this beauty. Here's a pic from yesterday when I took it for a ride. Can't believe I'm actually driving it. Definitely what I deserve after all this hard work. Every time I step in, it's like an adrenaline rush!\n[Image caption: a photo of a red sports car parked on the side of the road]\n[S2T5] (dia_id: D2:5)\n\nDave: Calvin, that car looks awesome! You must feel amazing every time you get inside! You deserved it - congrats buddy!\n[S2T6] (dia_id: D2:6)\n\nCalvin: Woah, I'm on cloud nine! Hard work pays off. What's up with you, Dave?\n[S2T7] (dia_id: D2:7)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! Doing good. Last weekend, I went to a music festival in Boston - it was awesome! So many cool bands playing and the atmosphere was electric. I love music, it reminded me why I love it. Here's a pic, take a look.\n[Image caption: a photo of a large crowd of people at a concert]\n[S2T8] (dia_id: D2:8)\n\nCalvin: Wow, sounds like a blast! Which one was your favorite?\n[S2T9] (dia_id: D2:9)\n\nDave: Wow, there were so many great bands! If I had to pick a favorite, it would definitely be Aerosmith. Their performance was incredible. I'll show you a pic I took when they were playing.\n[Image caption: a photo of a concert with a large eagle on the stage]\n[S2T10] (dia_id: D2:10)\n\nCalvin: Cool! Lovin' Aerosmith.\n[S2T11] (dia_id: D2:11)\n\nDave: I finally saw them live and it was such an amazing experience! He was jamming out to one of their hits. Check out this epic picture of them!\n[Image caption: a photo of two people on stage with guitars and a microphone]\n[S2T12] (dia_id: D2:12)\n\nCalvin: Cool, Dave! Seeing your favorite singers live must have been wild! Did you get a chance to hang out with them after the show?\n[S2T13] (dia_id: D2:13)\n\nDave: Nah, didn't get to hang with them after the show, but seeing them live was cool enough. It's always a dream to see your favorites performing!\n[S2T14] (dia_id: D2:14)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, it's always a dream to see your favorites doing their thing! So glad you got to experience that.\n[S2T15] (dia_id: D2:15)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! Yeah, it was an incredible experience. So, anything new happening in your life?\n[S2T16] (dia_id: D2:16)\n\nCalvin: Got a new ride and wrote some new tunes - had a few studio sessions last week and I'm excited to collaborate. Can't wait to share it with everyone!\n[S2T17] (dia_id: D2:17)\n\nDave: Cool, Calvin! Looking forward to hearing your new tunes. Keep me updated on how your collaborations go!\n[S2T18] (dia_id: D2:18)","text_sha256":"712aee03ff74bd7be750fe994ff27def0e42f6fb1a5bde81f34de3147cf5b10c","timestamp":"2023-03-26T16:45:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"08302ae53c7681312a62f5734d6ef73dfd8c86405ba319838bd79230cce094d2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D30:17"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":70,"line_start":69,"source_locators":["[S30T17]"],"text_sha256":"7353599b7b6aa3add9369386fe63e573e57fc33f1c754c64ebafaf9813e2f7e3"},{"dia_ids":["D30:18"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":73,"line_start":72,"source_locators":["[S30T18]"],"text_sha256":"93903ca5fc66f1393cd949d9b5697e4670e937d73832ba642dde79a5b6108a6b"},{"dia_ids":["D30:19"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":76,"line_start":75,"source_locators":["[S30T19]"],"text_sha256":"d3409c3c5b5ad2ce128f16214d25059802667ef86a148b8fe79d16a7062bf441"},{"dia_ids":["D30:20"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":79,"line_start":78,"source_locators":["[S30T20]"],"text_sha256":"e1b22e39f7f68eb9f1e020b731b2c13b7e9a46b058265b08cc1805db823aafe3"},{"dia_ids":["D30:21"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":82,"line_start":81,"source_locators":["[S30T21]"],"text_sha25