you in on all the details. Catch up with you soon!\n[S30T20] (dia_id: D30:20)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin! That's amazing news! Congratulations on both the gala attendance and the upcoming performance. I can't wait to hear all about it and maybe even catch one of your shows in Boston. Let me know when you're free to catch up. Cheers to your musical journey!\n[S30T21] (dia_id: D30:21)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! I'll catch you when I'm in Boston. Cheers!\n[S30T22] (dia_id: D30:22)\n\nDave: Looking forward to seeing you. Stay safe, talk to you soon!\n[S30T23] (dia_id: D30:23)\n\nCalvin: Thanks! You too. Talk to you later!\n[S30T24] (dia_id: D30:24)","text_sha256":"7060194f04ebef5c26c5a6ef1221a9b6a198637ba538c13b250b15d715abeec7","timestamp":"2023-11-17T10:54:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","pre_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":669,"filesystem_tool_calls":0,"model_calls":4,"orchestration_calls":4,"prompt_tokens":11573,"provider_request_attempts":4,"provider_rounds":4,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":12242},"model":{"requested_model":"x-test-2","served_models":["deepseek-v4.1-flash"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"6930d93099ac20b76e881b68cbb63b46e1a0a3e2ff43453db685551c3339a6dc","filesystem_tools_sha256":"98017e74a12c2eec4f0139c484d2d6bd809e4f37a8f96c7f419dc9591563dbfa","orchestration_actions_sha256":"3fa6b1160c2f7f9b2a8b3e232721d4ca78a161abb31af0d4f1f2e307b7354581","paper_prompt_id":"refind-appendix-a-stage1-plus-temporal-normalized-v1","paper_prompt_sha256":"20422063cc471ee1de75c38e4250e1a141a731ea2970786a6c715dc3c83cf7de"},"protocol_version":"shared-evidence-bundle-v1","question":{"conversation_id":"conv-50","question":"When did a mishap occur with Calvin's musical gear and favorite mic?","question_id":"conv-50-q010","question_set_id":"locomo-conv50-main40-v1","run